// Dialog :
"P3909755453" "You really performed under pressure, {HeroName}. I don't want to think about what would have happened if the Sky Raiders had managed to access the teleportation grid. Instead of the hospital, injured heroes might have found themselves in a Sky Raider brig!"
// RandomFameString :
"P4014038308" "{HeroName} stopped a Sky Raider attack over at Crey."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P571836654" "The good news is that Portal Corp. was able to reestablish control of the grid within minutes. The bad news? Well, the Sky Raiders made good use of those minutes. They stole a cache of military weapons and a load of gold bullion. At least they were stopped before they secured the fighter jets and the plutonium!"

