"P3750057258" "Last week the Sky Raiders hijacked a police transport carrying confiscated weapons. I just got a lead on the base where they're storing their ill-gotten gain. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to recover those weapons, {HeroName}.</a> Be careful; this base is under the leadership of {BOSS_NAME}. I hear he's a tough customer."
