// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_SkyRaiders_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1579375671" "The Sky Raiders have gotten much bolder lately. They used to focus on small, covert operations, but now they have a much higher profile. Why don't you see what you can do about driving them back into their hole? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Make it clear the Sky Raiders aren't welcome in Paragon City.</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2561402587" "Make it clear the Sky raiders aren't welcome in Paragon City"
// SendOffString :
"P2183546869" "With the technology and tactics available to them, the Sky Raiders could become a very dangerous group."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3648235160" "Combat Sky Raider menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2338922993" "Those Sky Raiders are out there waiting for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P527901687" "You are picking the wrong fight, hero."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2011817175" "This gadget will let you fly for a short while. You'll need it if you're going up against the Sky Raiders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P772367778" "You have put a dent in the frequency of Sky Raider attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1621838537" "I think you really gave the Sky Raiders something to worry about, {HeroName}. Maybe that will keep them off the streets for a little while."
// RandomFameString :
"P1960081648" "I saw {HeroName} grounding a bunch of Sky Raiders earlier."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_SkyRaiders_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4249499030" "The Sky Raiders have been conducting a lot of operations in Terra Volta. Security in that zone has had their hands full with the Freakshow and the Devouring Earth; they haven't been able to do anything about the Sky Raider attacks except catalog what's being stolen. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to curtail the Sky Raider thefts in Terra Volta.</A> Can you do it?"
// AcceptString :
"P3455301229" "Curtail the Sky Raider thefts in Terra Volta"
// SendOffString :
"P35689268" "There have been a lot of thefts around the Raysun Petroleum Refinery and the Coroman Manufacturing Complex."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2528632028" "Combat Sky Raiders in Terra Volta"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P754125791" "You need to defeat more Sky Raiders. Terra Volta needs your help."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3864143344" "You have discouraged the Sky Raiders' thefts in Terra Volta."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2400013633" "Great job in Terra Volta, {HeroName}. I think you showed the Sky Raiders that Paragon City won't stand for their wanton thefts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL4_SkyRaiders_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3787959374" "The Sky Raiders seem to be staging a lot of operations against the Terra Volta reactor complex. The city depends on that reactor to keep the force fields in place; without them, there'd be nothing to stop villains from traveling freely between city zones. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like someone to show the Sky Raiders they're not welcome anywhere near the reactor.</A> And I think that someone ought to be you."
// AcceptString :
"P2049744517" "Show the Sky Raiders they're not welcome anywhere near the reactor"
// SendOffString :
"P872890981" "There's been a lot of Sky Raider activity around the Coroman Manufacturing Complex and the Challenger Technology facility. I suggest starting in one of those areas."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1031934851" "I don't think the Sky Raiders are getting the message. Hit 'em hard, {HeroName}."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2842778237" "You have disrupted the Sky Raiders' activities in Terra Volta."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1753987009" "Thanks for your help in Terra Volta, {HeroName}. It's every hero's job to make sure that the Sky Raiders can't interfere with the reactor."

